    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Cyber Hearts Club</strong> \u2013 a brutal battlefield where only the strongest survive. In this action-packed team-based shooter, you\u2019ll fight across war-torn cities and abandoned ruins in a world ravaged by the apocalypse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a variety of unique classes, each with their own weapons and abilities, and engage in fast-paced combat against players or AI-controlled enemies. Whether you prefer close-quarters chaos or long-range precision, teamwork is the key to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Team-based PvP battles</strong> \u2013 Fight alongside allies in strategic multiplayer combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Offline mode</strong> \u2013 Take on AI opponents and sharpen your skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse classes</strong> \u2013 Pick a role that suits your playstyle, from heavy firepower to agile assassins.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Post-apocalyptic world</strong> \u2013 Battle in dystopian environments full of danger and decay.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the fight. Earn your place in <strong>Cyber Hearts Club</strong>!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Cyber Hearts Club</strong> \u2013 a brutal battlefield where only the strongest survive. In this action-packed team-based shooter, you\u2019ll fight across war-torn cities and abandoned ruins in a world ravaged by the apocalypse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a variety of unique classes, each with their own weapons and abilities, and engage in fast-paced combat against players or AI-controlled enemies. Whether you prefer close-quarters chaos or long-range precision, teamwork is the key to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Team-based PvP battles</strong> \u2013 Fight alongside allies in strategic multiplayer combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Offline mode</strong> \u2013 Take on AI opponents and sharpen your skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse classes</strong> \u2013 Pick a role that suits your playstyle, from heavy firepower to agile assassins.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Post-apocalyptic world</strong> \u2013 Battle in dystopian environments full of danger and decay.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the fight. Earn your place in <strong>Cyber Hearts Club</strong>!</p>",
